# Build context of the API image is serving/ (P1-DCK-01), so the repository's .git, private/, training/, notebooks/,
# artifacts/ (model package), reports/ and the dataset are never sent to the builder.
# Allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include only what the Dockerfile copies.
*
!requirements.txt
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
# never inside the image, even if they appear under src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.venv
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.onnx
**/*.pth
